  title: Anglo-Sikh Wars
  text: After Ranjit Singh's death, two wars, in 1845 to 1846 and 1848 to 1849, led to the annexation of Punjab in 1849. The Koh-i-Noor diamond was taken from the young Maharaja Duleep Singh.
